[TITLE]
IO-49: binary output header date with a late REPORT_START
(the test rewrites REPORT_START_TIME and REPORT_STEP for every case)

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    01:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             03:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
ROUTING_STEP         60

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1      10    3         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
O1      9     FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1  J1  O1  100  0.013  0  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1  CIRCULAR  1.0  0  0  0  1

[INFLOWS]
J1  FLOW  ""  FLOW  1.0  1.0  1.0

[REPORT]
NODES     ALL
LINKS     ALL
